  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/662675/description_8815679d-4c27-448a-8268-39fbfef443b9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"730\" height=\"250\"></p><h4><strong>📖 关于：</strong></h4><p>End's Delight 是一个为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 设计的附加模组，专注于为末地添加烹饪内容！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>📦 测试版本</strong></h4><p>该模组目前<strong>正在开发中</strong>，因此可能会出现问题和不稳定情况。如果你想体验，请注意：</p><ul>\n<li><strong>经常备份你的存档</strong>；</li>\n<li>在将其添加到整合包之前，确保一切正常运行；</li>\n</ul><h4><strong>🔨</strong><strong>必要依赖</strong>&nbsp;</h4><p><strong>Forge：</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>-Farmer's Delight</strong></a></p><p><strong>Fabric：</strong></p><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">-Farmer's Delight [Fabric]</a></strong></p><p><strong>Refabricated：</strong></p><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-refabricated\" rel=\"nofollow\">-Farmer's Delight Refabricated</a></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>✨我的新模组</strong></p><p><strong>🌿<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tea-aroma\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tea Aroma</a></strong></p>",
